window.products.push({"id":216248,"name":"JACKGOLD 7 Inch 8-piece Set Fit All 3.2qt-6.8qt, Air Fryer Accessories 8 Pcs Kits with Skewers Silicone Mat,Non-Stick, Dishwasher Safe,Universal, Blac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ukeN8NgIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy happy cooking time with your family! With the help of this 8-piece air fryer accessory, bake your favorite cake in the \"cake bucket\", cook delicious pizza in the \"pizza pan\", use the \"metal stand\" to maximize your cooking surface, and pass \"Multi-function rack\" for making skewers! Cake pan The air fryer cake pan is a universal accessory. After adding the special cake pan to the fryer series, you can bake like a professional. Pizza pan In addition to trying different pizza recipes, this pizza pan also provides a perfect surface for various other cuisines! You can use it to make pancakes, eggs, potatoes, quesadillas and even big cookies! With the air fryer accessory bakeware, the possibilities are endless! Metal bracket Maximize the cooking area and keep sticky food away from the bottom of the fryer. Heat-resistant pliers Most food cooked in an air fryer needs to be turned halfway. Having a good set of pliers will help. Skewers You can put some vegetables and grilled meat here. Parchment air fryer lining Certain foods, especially those coated with flour or breadcrumbs, stick to the bottom of the air fryer. You will never encounter this problem when using these liners, and they are very easy to clean. The circular inner liner with a diameter of 7 inches is perfect for most air fryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ukeN8NgIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JACKGOLD","source_asin":"B08GP2PX2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GP2PX2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GP2PX2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
