window.products.push({"id":216289,"name":"XIYAO Collapsible Storage Bins with Lids, 8.4 Gal Clear Plastic Closet Organizers and Storage box, Large Size Stackable Cube Storage Containers With W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZMcYI8TqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Foldable & Stackable】The lid of this folding storage box features groove, they can be stacked together firmly to keep your bedroom or wardrobe organized. Besides, storage bins allow to fold flat when not use and placed under the bed or sofa, this stackable storage bins is more flexible to use. 【Easy Installation & Moveable】These collapsible storage bins will come in a folded shape, and is install-free, only takes about 10s to snap pieces together. These bedroom storage organizers are built-in detachable wheels on the bottom to make them easy to move when doing cleaning. (We provide 4 large wheels to facilitate the storage box to adapt to any direction of movement). 【All Five Doors Can Be Opened】The front door of the clear plastic storage box has a built-in latch, and the sliding handle controls the locking and unlocking of the door to ensure that the door will not open by itself. The all sides of the box are clear and can also be opened separately. When you need to take the side items, you can open them directly from the side which is more convenient. 【High quality materials】The plastic collapsible storage bins are made of durable and heavy-duty PP material, which is sturdy, odorless, and durable. There is a small space on the top for storing some products (such as desiccant, etc.) that can prevent clothes from getting wet. 【Large Storage Capacity & Multi Function】The size of clear plastic storage bins:18.7Lx13.9Wx9.44H inches, Maximum load capacity 8.4 Gal. The folding storage box is a versatile storage bins that can be used as bathroom organizer, kitchen organization, closet organizer, dog food storage container, food storage containers, laundry room organization, toy storage, car organizer, Christmas decorations clearance, bedroom storage, snack organizer, book bins, hat storage, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZMcYI8TqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XIYAO","source_asin":"B0BX5MYBYN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX5MYBYN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX5MYBYN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
