window.products.push({"id":216294,"name":"Niwo ART (TM - Flaming June, Frederic Leighton - Oil Painting Reproduction - Giclee Wall Art for Home Decor,Office or Lobby, Gallery Wrapped, Stretche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xb7efgwCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"01 Flaming June Year Created: 1895, by Frederic LeightonCurrent Location: Museo de Arte de Ponce,Ponce,Puerto Rico Background: Flaming June was first begun as a motif to adorn a marble bath in one of Leighton's other works, Summer Slumber. Flaming June has become Leighton's most recognisable picture. The realism of the transparent material worn by the sleeping woman, the stunningly rich colours and the perfectly recreated marble surround are characteristic of Leighton's work, as is his use of natural light.He allows the sunset in the background to appear as molten gold. Here are reasons You're Going to LOVE Your Niwo Art (TM) Canvas Prints: - Made in USA, Fast & free shipping. A perfect choice for wall decor at home and in office. Also makes a perfect gift. - 100% HANDMADE Each canvas print hand-stretched. Multiple sizes available.- State of the art 12-ink Giclee print technology from Canon ensures the best quality, realizes an expanded range which enables greater overall balance and provides more vivid colors.- Pigment-based inks rather than other inks found in lower cost inkjets. Pigment-based inks have a longer life span that can last over 100 years without significant fading.- Acid free archival quality canvas made of 100% cotton.- Coated with water-based varnish to protect and preserve fine art and photographic prints. It will enhance the color, increase resistance to image fading, and protect prints against moisture and abrasion. - Gallery Wrap. We are adding an extra 0.75-1.5 inch necessary for the borders using some pixels from the edges of your image and creating a border.- Real wood frame (Non-MDF) & Solvent-free Ink: odorless and can be used by someone with allergies and in kids' rooms.- Ready to hang. Hook is mounted inside of the frame so no gap visible between wall and the frame. Frame is wrapped very carefully in bubble or foam wrap to ensure safe shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xb7efgwCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Niwo ART","source_asin":"B075CH1SFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075CH1SFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075CH1SFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
