window.products.push({"id":216300,"name":"SilKicah Mulberry Silk Comforter King Size, 100% Natural Mulberry Silk Filled Duvet Breathable Lightweight Pure Silk Quilt for Summer Season(102\"×90\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81STOHj+n-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Sleep Quality Promotion] - SilKicah Mulberry silk quilt is light, airy, and smooth for an incredibly comfortable sleeping experience, easily contouring to your body for a cozy and relaxing sleep. Compared to other material filled comforter, it is more breathable, super soft, and won’t rustle. Besides, silk is great for your skin and hair for it helps retain moisture and reduce damage caused by fabrics with high friction. [Body Temperature Regulating] – It keeps you cool in summer and warm in winter. The natural thermal regulator property of Mulberry silk provides a consistent temperature for sleep, and its great moisture absorption ability keeps your bed dry, thus withstanding most temperatures and seasons. Magically, using the SilKicah silk-filled comforter, you will no longer have hot flashes and night sweat nor chills. Hot sleepers deserve to own one. [Allergy Free] – 100% mulberry silk comforter helps you fall in deep sleep especially for those persons and who often sweat and cough at night. It keeps moisture away from your body. SilKicah natural silk-filled comforter would be an excellent option for people who tend to be allergic often. [Exquisite Craftsmanship & Tie System] - King(102”x90”), net silk weight: 2.43Ib, total weight: 5.95Ib; the 20” invisible zipper near the washing label for silk filling inspection; 4 corner tabs and 4 side loops allow you to tie silk comforter in place in a duvet, and are easy for you to overlap two comforters together (binding ties included) to defeat cold seasons. Thus, it is very convenient to overlap two duvets when you feel cold and just use one quilt when you feel hot. [Fit Nature into Your Life & Use a Duvet Cover] – All materials are sourced from nature. We source selected 100% long strand mulberry silk of top grade as filling and 100% long staple cotton as shell, providing luxury silk bedding and improving sleep quality for you. Reminder: A silk filled comforter must be used with a removable cover for protection and just wash the cover only when it’s dirty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81STOHj+n-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SilKicah","source_asin":"B08H4QPLGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4QPLGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4QPLGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
