window.products.push({"id":216361,"name":"Pillowcases Queen Gray Set of 2 Envelope Closure End Easy Fit for Summer Soft and Breathable Material Machine Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Csl-R22mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 2 Queen-size Pillowcases - 20 x 30 inches. Material: High-quality polyester with double-brushed microfiber craftsmanship, providing a strong and durable protection for the pillow. Its silky softness ensures a comfortable and sound sleeping experience that will wake you up feeling refreshed in the morning. Design: Unique envelope closure design for easy covering, protection, and keeping your pillow clean and in place. No more zippers and no more escaping pillows. Our pillowcases are suitable for guest rooms, bedrooms, sofas, and more. The simple design of the pillowcases, combined with their durability and softness, helps you sleep well. We offer a variety of colors to choose from, so you can find the perfect one to match your decor. Care Instructions: Machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle. Cool iron if needed. Do not bleach. Service Concept: With a reasonable price and excellent quality, please feel confident placing your order. If there are any issues, feel free to reach us. We also offer a return and replacement service within 90 days, ensuring customer satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Csl-R22mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mohap","source_asin":"B0758757YW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0758757YW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0758757YW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":216362,"name":"Exotic Sands Md14 USA Medium Alder Frame (Arctic Glacier) Moving Sand Pictures by William Tabar. #1 Rated Sand Art. Best","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":126.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NcdiwtisL._AC_.jpg","description":"Medium Horizontal 7x12 Inch OD Moving Sand Pictures. The double strength glass is framed with a quality knotty alder wood frame. Air bubbles hold up the sand creating unique scenes with every turn, pictures may take from just minutes to many hours to finish a scene. The black sand is heavier than the white sands so the sands will never mix. Some of the sands are transparent and some opaque giving the pictures a 3-D effect. Ocean Blue - Blue liquid with black sand, four types of white sands and a fine blue glitter. Summer Turquoise - Turquoise liquid with black sand, green sands from South America, four types of white sands and a hint of fine sea foam green glitter. Sunset Orange - Orange liquid with black sand, coral pink sand from Southern Utah, four types of white sands and a hint of fine copper glitter. Arctic Glacier - Clear liquid with black sand, four types of white sands and a hint of fine blue glitter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NcdiwtisL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exotic Sands","source_asin":"B00WRPD0HG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WRPD0HG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WRPD0HG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":216363,"name":"Bliwans Zebra Roller Shades, Zebra Blinds for Windows, Dual Layer, Sheer Privacy or Light Filtering for Day and Night, Roll Up and Down, Window Blinds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716AOL2P-wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌞【Safety Chain Design】Our window blinds can be smoothly and silently rolled up to have clear view outside with metal chain. Each roller zebra blinds is equipped with a safety chain connector, you can fix the chain to the wall, which always keep cords and bead chain out of children or pets. Our roller blinds have free stop runs as expected by pull it up and down. 🌞【Excellent Material】Featured with 100% high quality polyester which is good ventilation, anti-static, dust-proof, durable. Our zebra roller shades have been upgraded to have a sturdier bottom rail to prevent the fabric from fraying, which makes the two layers of fabrics more closely fit, maximizing the effect of shading. Besides, there is an anti-collision strip installed under the rail, which can protect your window frame. The upgraded mechanism provides high stability and smoothness. 🌞【Light Control & Privacy Protection】Double layers window covering switch between sheer and light filtering sheer easily. Zebra blinds is designed in a combination of sheer and solid fabric in horizontal stripes, by manually adjusting the density of indoor light, isolate the external line of sight to provide both privacy and light control. With their dual layer drawstring system, they allow for easy adjustments to create either a semi-sheer or fully opaque window covering, making them perfect for day and night use. Good UV protection and nice durability for all season long. 🌞【Multiple Window Treatment】Classic stylish colors and minimalist designs for different interior decoration styles. Our zebra roller blinds provide an elegant and modern look to any window. Suitable blinds for windows, home, living room, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, study, nursery, office, french door and more. 🌞【Easy to Install】Zebra blinds can be mounted on the inside or outside of the window frame. All necessary accessories are included in the package, and the mounting instructions are provided for quick and easy mounting. All shades have a little deduction. Inside Mounting blinds windows require a minimum 2\" window frame depth, blinds width need to be 1/4\" less than window width. 🌞【Easy to Clean】Window shades has the permeability high quality polyester fabric is durable and easy to clean. If you notice any stains or stubborn spots, you can clean soiled blinds and shades by using a damp sponge or clean cloth with a small amount of mild detergent on it. If you use soap on your blinds and shades, use a light touch and avoid completely saturating the fabric. Let the blinds dry completely by leaving them open so they can air properly. 💡【Shipping and Service】Amazon are takes charge of the all FBA Orders shipment. 💌 If you have any questions about the size of the blinds & shades, please feel free to contact Bliwans before purchasing. ❤️ Please don't hesitate to seek help if you have any problems on products, each product come with a warranty & online assistance for all the customers, and we will reply and deal with it within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716AOL2P-wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bliwans","source_asin":"B0BQ75CSLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ75CSLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ75CSLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
