window.products.push({"id":216403,"name":"Andency Red Quilt Set Queen(90x90Inch), 3 Pieces (1 Plaid Quilt and 2 Pillowcases) Red Grid Bedspread Set, Soft Microfiber Lightweight Reversible Chec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qg0q0lj0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Red Plaid Quilt Set: Andency queen quilt set is designed in a red-black plaid pattern, classic and never goes out of style. This red quilt set would not only make your room look more textural but also offer you a modern and fashionable atmosphere. Our plaid bedspread set is elegant and minimalist. It's a perfect choice for your bedroom, guest room, or kids' room. Queen Size Quilt Set: 3 pieces red queen quilt set includes 1 red plaid quilt(90\" x 90\") and 2 pillowcases (20\" x 26\"), which would fit your queen size bed. If you want a quilt that drapes all the way to the floor, you may have a low bed or choose the larger size. You also can use our red plaid quilt on the couch or sofa while reading or watching TV. Exquisite Quilted Design: Why our plaid quilt set is your better choice? As compared with other ordinary quilts, our plaid coverlet uses a delicate geometric quilted stitching, so that the outer layer and the filling are tightly fixed together and keep the thickness of the quilt uniform, but also gives the plaid quilt extra decorative and artistic value. Comfy Soft Microfiber: Andency plaid coverlet set is made from 100% soft microfiber, which is lightweight and more breathable. In summer, our red bedspread is enough to keep you warm and keep you away from sweat at the same time. In winter, you also could use it under or upon a comforter to have warmer and sweeter dreams. Warm Tips: Since our quilt set is packaged in a vacuum bag, it's highly recommended you gently shake and pat it before using it. And we suggest you machine wash separately on a gentle cycle with cold water. Tumble dry low, do not iron or use bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qg0q0lj0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andency","source_asin":"B093Q4L2PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093Q4L2PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093Q4L2PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":216404,"name":"Narasumas by Marc Allante, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815bC+bYJ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor painting of two intertwined JELLYFISH. Hong Kong born artist Marc All ante exhibited a passion for the visual arts from an early age. Having lived in Hong Kong, Sydney and London, his work is inspired in both form and style by these Western and Eastern influences. Merging traditional Chinese inks with European watercolor and Pen techniques in a contemporary style reflects the fusion of his Chinese - French ancestry and brings it into a modern context. Represented by the Avenue des arts gallery in Hong Kong, this entirely self taught artist utilizes a variety of techniques, subject matter and themes to expand the repertoire of his ink and art collection. Gisele (jeep-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that gale printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of gale by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815bC+bYJ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01MT1GW1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT1GW1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT1GW1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
