window.products.push({"id":216685,"name":"Disney Mickey Mouse Red Drinking Mug with Arm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NRiqn1FbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether it’s for kids, women, men, or teens - this mug will be loved by Mickey fans, making it a cool & unique gift idea for Christmas, holidays, and birthdays. Sculpted to look like Mickey’s iconic red and white polka pants, it has his yellow shoes acting as a stand and his gloved hand on his hip as the handle. The mug 5.3 x 3.9 x 4.05 inches and it holds up to 16 oz. of coffee, hot chocolate, tea, or whatever drink warms you up. Do not microwave, and hand wash only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NRiqn1FbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAB Starpoint","source_asin":"B091RLLYYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091RLLYYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091RLLYYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":216686,"name":"Juicer Machine, ORFELD Slow Masticating Juicer Extractor Easy to Clean, Quiet Motor and Reverse Function, Cold Press Juicer Machine for Vegetable and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zu2JqRQcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍇[2 Speed Modes] The ORFELD 1505 juicer adopts two speeds, soft/hard, it can extract a variety of fruits and vegetables to meet different needs. The reverse function can reduce the food residue in the crushed juicer and avoid clogging. 🍎[Easy to Assemble and Clean] Click one button to disassemble the juicer in a few seconds, you can easily clean the juicer. All detachable parts are made of food-grade materials and can be cleaned in a dishwasher. 🍹[90% Juice Output and Nutrition Maintenance] 7 segments spiral auger opening up each cell for maximum juicing fruits and vegetables, slow masticating can produce up to 90% juice output, which is higher than most juicers. 🍠[Quiet and Safe Operation] Below 65 decibels, you can prepare morning drinks without disturbing families. Equipped with a intelligent protection chip, the juicer automatically stops working every 20 minutes to ensure security. 🍷[ORFELD Warranty service] The ORFELD team provides a 1-year warranty, 3-year quality assurance and life time technical support. 🍑[Juicing advice] If you need to squeeze high-fiber fruits and vegetables, you can add some soft fruits to avoid clogging the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zu2JqRQcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORFELD","source_asin":"B0918NS1FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0918NS1FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0918NS1FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
