window.products.push({"id":216777,"name":"Popup Card, Pop up Cards for All Occasions - Pop up Cards Birthday - Well Made and (Happy Birthday Cake), Birthday, Class, Teacher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+W1EQTr2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY WE CELEBRATE HAPPY BIRTHDAY EVERY YEAR? The birthday is the most special day in everyone’s life. Every year, we wait for this day. On your birthday, you are the most VIP person in the whole world and GIVE many gifts, wishes, flowers... from your beloved, your friend, your family,.... Everyone, who knows you or via any social media calls you or texts you wish you good health. And, you also many plans for your birthday celebration, among which, party is the list topper. Why Birthday Cakes ? One of the stories came from the Greek tradition. That is about baking round cakes to represent the full moon  ☪ to their moon goddess , Artemis. And the candle they used in the middle was to make the cake glow like the full moon. Germans are also given accreditation for being the first cake makers. They used to bake round layered cake. They used to light a big candle in the middle to celebrate the ‘Light of Life’. Also, they believed that the smoke from the candle carried their birthday wishes up to the heaven. ☀ AND THIS REASON WHY WE MAKE BIRTHDAY POP UP CARDS ☀ - For your beloved with all wishes you can write on these birthday pop up cards - Your beloved recieve the happy birthday cakes model from you easily with entirety meaningful - Amazing and creative gifts for him/her ❤ DO YOU WANT BEST WISHES FOR HIM/HER?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+W1EQTr2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HapiPop","source_asin":"B07DH7544Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DH7544Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DH7544Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
