window.products.push({"id":216979,"name":"LEEWADEE Bone Cushion – Shape-Retaining Cervical Neck Pillow, Tube Cushion for Comfortable Reading, Made of Eco-Friendly Kapok, 7 x 12 x 7 inches, Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9Fg1KQVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Leewadee bone neck cushion – meditation and relaxation pillow The Leewadee bone pillow comes in a small, compact format and offers excellent comfort and softness. The yoga neck pillow can be used for various occasions. On the one hand, it provides a pleasant position for both reading on the sofa or a yoga mat. On the other hand, the bone-shaped roll cushion works as a practical utensil for traveling and as the ideal support to relax and unwind. Also, the neck supporting pillow can be used for meditation. The neck cushion is especially light and easy to carry and can therefore be stored quickly. Additionally, the cervical pillow offers firmness and robustness. The fabrics used consist of natural materials. The special kapok filling increases the firm structure of the bone cushion and adds a supporting effect. Product features Material - Cover: cotton Material - Cover: cotton Material - Filling: kapok Material - Filling: kapok Dimensions bone-shaped cushion: 7 x 12 x 7 inches (WxDxH) Dimensions bone-shaped cushion: 7 x 12 x 7 inches (WxDxH) Special features Upholstered bone pillow for relaxation and meditation Upholstered bone pillow for relaxation and meditation Traditional Thai design Traditional Thai design Double seams for better durability Double seams for better durability The perfect complement The practical neck pillow can be combined with the Leewadee yoga block or the Leewadee yoga bolster. Whether at home or in a studio, this neck pillow can be used on various occasions and offers the possibility to improve yoga-skills and to intensify workouts. Leewadee – Interior and more The Leewadee brand stands for sophisticated design using natural materials. From fancy floor vases, matching dry and decorative branches to seat cushions, mats, and yoga blocks, the wide range of products includes everything needed for a harmonious environment. Our products are handmade. For this reason, each product is unique and may vary in shape, color, and size.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9Fg1KQVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEEWADEE","source_asin":"B08QJ7PW4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-216979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QJ7PW4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QJ7PW4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
